@taskManagerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033
@contentType = application/json

### Get all tasks
GET {{taskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/task
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Get task by ID
GET {{taskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/task/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Create a new task
POST {{taskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/task
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

